<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>Digital Verification Workflow — TrueScale Docs</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --ts-dark: #001e2b;
            --ts-green: #00ed64;
            --ts-green-dark: #00684a;
            --ts-green-light: #e8fff1;
            --ts-gray-50: #f8fafc;
            --ts-gray-100: #f1f5f9;
            --ts-gray-200: #e2e8f0;
            --ts-gray-600: #475569;
            --ts-radius: 16px;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--ts-gray-50);
            color: var(--ts-dark);
            min-height: 100dvh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        /* Top Header */
        header {
            background: white;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ts-gray-200);
            padding: 0 clamp(16px, 5vw, 48px);
            height: 72px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--ts-dark);
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .logo-img {
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 24px;
        }

        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--ts-gray-600);
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
        }

        nav a:hover, nav a.active {
            color: var(--ts-dark);
        }

        .header-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .btn-nav {
            padding: 9px 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background: white;
            color: var(--ts-dark);
            border: 1px solid var(--ts-gray-200);
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: var(--ts-gray-100);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--ts-dark);
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--ts-dark);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #003043;
        }

        /* Container */
        .verification-section {
            width: min(94%, 960px);
            margin: clamp(20px, 4vw, 40px) auto;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--ts-gray-200);
            border-radius: var(--ts-radius);
            padding: clamp(30px, 5vw, 60px) clamp(18px, 4vw, 44px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            position: relative;
        }

        .heading {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: clamp(32px, 5vw, 50px);
        }

        .heading h1 {
            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 40px);
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            color: var(--ts-dark);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .heading p {
            font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 18px);
            color: var(--ts-gray-600);
            line-height: 1.55;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Vertical Stepper */
        .steps {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .steps::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: 48px;
            top: 40px;
            bottom: 40px;
            border-left: 2px dashed #a7f3d0;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .step-card {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--ts-gray-200);
            border-radius: var(--ts-radius);
            padding: clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 24px) clamp(16px, 3vw, 28px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            gap: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .step-card:hover {
            transform: translateX(6px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0, 237, 100, 0.12);
            border-color: var(--ts-green);
        }

        .icon-box {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            background: var(--ts-green-light);
            border: 1.5px solid #c7f3d6;
            border-radius: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            color: var(--ts-green-dark);
            font-size: 26px;
        }

        .step-content {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 0;
        }

        .step-content h2 {
            font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 19px);
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            color: var(--ts-dark);
        }

        .step-content p {
            font-size: 13.5px;
            color: var(--ts-gray-600);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .step-number {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--ts-dark);
            background: var(--ts-gray-100);
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .step-card:hover .step-number {
            background: var(--ts-dark);
            color: var(--ts-green);
        }

        /* Responsive Breakpoints */
        @media (max-width: 800px) {
            nav {
                display: none;
            }

            .steps::before {
                display: none;
            }

            .step-card {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 14px;
            }

            .step-card:hover {
                transform: translateY(-3px);
            }

            .step-number {
                align-self: flex-end;
                margin-top: -30px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Top Header -->
    <header>
        <a href="/" class="logo">
            <img src="/images/logo.jpeg" alt="TrueScale Logo" class="logo-img">
            <span>TrueScale</span>
        </a>
        <nav>
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="/docs/digital-certificate">Certificate Flow</a>
            <a href="/docs/digital-verification" class="active">Digital Verification</a>
            <a href="/docs/inspector-assignment">Inspector Dispatch</a>
            <a href="/docs/qr-verification">QR Verification</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="header-actions">
            <a href="/login" class="btn-nav btn-outline">Log In</a>
            <a href="/signup" class="btn-nav btn-primary">Get Started</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="verification-section">
        <div class="heading">
            <h1>Digital Verification Flow</h1>
            <p>End-to-end digital lifecycle for weighing instrument calibration, diagnostics, and compliance approval.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="steps">

            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="icon-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h2>01. Instrument Registration</h2>
                    <p>Business owners submit instrument details including Machine ID, brand, model number, capacity, and operational address.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-number">01</div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="icon-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h2>02. Document & Invoice Upload</h2>
                    <p>Securely upload calibration histories, purchase invoices, and previous verification records.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-number">02</div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="icon-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-user-gear"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h2>03. Automated Inspector Assignment</h2>
                    <p>System matches jurisdictional territory and dispatches a certified Legal Metrology officer for on-site verification.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-number">03</div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="icon-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h2>04. Sensor Diagnostics & Field Testing</h2>
                    <p>Inspector tests load cells, tolerance thresholds, and environmental error margins with live photographic evidence.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-number">04</div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="icon-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-award"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h2>05. Verification Approval & Digital Certificate</h2>
                    <p>State authority validates test reports and issues a tamper-evident, QR-traceable Certificate of Verification.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-number">05</div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

</body>
</html>